// Settings panel translations.
"Lid angle" = "屏幕开合角度";
"This Mac has no lid angle sensor. Only some MacBook models have one." = "这台 Mac 没有屏幕开合角度传感器。只有部分 MacBook 机型配备该传感器。";
"Depth effect" = "景深效果";
"Leans the screen away as the lid closes." = "合上屏幕时，画面会向后倾斜。";
"Live rendering" = "实时渲染";
"Off holds the frame from when the effect started." = "关闭后，画面将停留在效果开始时的那一帧。";
"Start" = "触发设置";
"Start angle" = "起始角度";
"The effect starts at this angle." = "屏幕合至此角度时开始生效。";
"Full effect after" = "完全生效所需角度";
"Degrees of further closing to reach full strength." = "继续合上此角度后，效果达到最强。";
"Look" = "外观";
"Blur" = "模糊强度";
"Blur radius at the far edge." = "画面远端边缘的模糊半径。";
"Blur spread" = "模糊范围";
"0 blurs the far edge only, 100 the whole picture." = "0 仅模糊远端边缘，100 则模糊整个画面。";
"Dimming" = "变暗强度";
"How dark the far edge goes." = "画面远端边缘的变暗程度。";
"Dimming spread" = "变暗范围";
"Everything above this height goes fully dark." = "此高度以上的画面达到最大变暗强度。";
"Perspective" = "透视";
"Lean back" = "后倾幅度";
"Degrees of lean per degree of closing. 1 holds it still." = "每合上 1° 时画面的后倾角度。设为 1 时，画面在空间中保持不动。";
"0 keeps the sides parallel, 100 converges sharply." = "0 保持两侧平行，100 则使两侧明显向内收拢。";
"Show angle in menu bar" = "在菜单栏显示角度";
"Launch at login" = "登录时启动";
"Reset" = "重置";
"Quit" = "退出";
"Made by " = "作者：";
"Screen Recording permission is required to show the depth effect." = "需要屏幕录制权限才能显示景深效果。";
"Open System Settings" = "打开系统设置";
"Could not open System Settings. Open it manually and enable screen recording for Mac Duo under Privacy & Security." = "无法打开系统设置。请手动打开，在“隐私与安全性”中为 Mac Duo 开启屏幕录制权限。";
"Language" = "语言";
"Switch to Chinese" = "切换为中文";
"Switch to English" = "切换为英文";
